-- Go Hargeisa — Pinnacle Perfumes & Cosmetics: premium storefront data pass
--
-- Two data-only changes, both traced to a specific verified public source
-- (Pinnacle's own real corporate catalog site, pinnacleperfumes.com — an
-- Odoo e-commerce store, same domain/pattern already used for this
-- listing's existing 21 products, confirmed live during this pass):
--
-- 1. Backfills real, publicly-listed USD prices onto the 20 of 21 existing
--    products that show a price on the live site (one, Estée Lauder Modern
--    Muse EDP 100ML, still shows no price there — left null, not guessed).
--    Corrects the business's display name from "Pinnacle perfumes and
--    cosmatics" to "Pinnacle Perfumes & Cosmetics" (spelling only — slug,
--    owner, contact info, category all untouched).
--
-- 2. Inserts 192 additional real products — each one's name, brand, size,
--    price, and product-image URL individually verified against a specific
--    numbered product listing on pinnacleperfumes.com/shop (pages 2, 4-12),
--    cross-checked by product ID against the existing 21 to guarantee zero
--    duplicates. Every product's gender ("men"/"women"/"unisex") is set
--    ONLY where the source site itself explicitly tagged it ([M]/[W]) or
--    named it "Unisex" — never guessed. All 213 products (21 existing + 192
--    new) are category='perfume': the live site's own navigation exposes
--    only "Perfumes for Her"/"Perfumes for Him"/"General Shop" — no
--    cosmetics, skincare, or makeup section exists on the verified source,
--    so none is fabricated here.
--
-- 3. Populates city_services.brands (currently an empty array, which is why
--    the storefront's own "Featured Brands" section has never rendered)
--    with the exact 32 distinct brand names actually present across the
--    213 verified products above — derived directly from the product data,
--    not a separately-typed list, so it can never drift out of sync with
--    what's actually stocked.
--
-- Purely additive/corrective, safe to re-run (idempotent updates; inserts
-- guarded by product-id-derived image-URL match so a re-run can't
-- duplicate).
-- ============================================================================

